==== Wave 1: Content

Content mods for this wave are the places, not the systems: scenery along the ferry route that makes cross-country flying feel real — airports, landmarks, regions, and anything that adds a reason to fly a particular leg.

One scenery addition was made at your direction on 2026-08-21 — the ground you fly over along the ferry route.

#mod-entry(
  "SimHeaven X-World",
  url: "https://simheaven.com/x-world-for-xp12/",
  deps: "X-World Vegetation Library (required, from the same site)",
  impact: "Replaces the sim's autogen with OSM and Microsoft-building-footprint placement — cities and terrain along the route look like the real places they are.",
  notes: "Freeware. Install the continental package(s) you fly (X-World America, X-World Europe, ...) plus the Vegetation Library, running its set_link_WIN.bat on Windows. Scenery order: below airports, above ortho/mesh — XFast Manager's smart sorting handles it. Current version: user to provide.",
